---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Kidtoy Factory privacy policy - what buyer enquiry data we collect, how it is stored, which processors we use, and how to request deletion.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: 21 October 2026</p>

    <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-500 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p>Kidtoy Factory is a toy manufacturer based in Chenghai, Guangdong, China. This policy explains what happens to information you send us through this website. For any privacy question, write to <a href="mailto:hntoys6@sinuotoys.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hntoys6@sinuotoys.com</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">2. What We Collect</h2>
      <p>We only collect what you choose to send us:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>Contact details you enter in an enquiry or quotation form — name, company, email, phone or WhatsApp, country;</li>
        <li>The content of your message, including product interests, quantities, target prices and any files you attach;</li>
        <li>Basic technical data recorded by our hosting provider, such as IP address, browser type, referring page and pages viewed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not ask for and do not want payment card numbers, identity documents or other sensitive personal data through this website.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">3. Why We Use It</h2>
      <p>To answer your enquiry, prepare quotations and samples, fulfil orders, and keep records required for export and tax purposes. We do not sell, rent or trade your information, and we do not add you to marketing lists without a separate opt-in.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">4. Service Providers</h2>
      <p>Limited data passes through the following processors, purely to operate this site:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting, CDN and traffic analytics for this domain;</li>
        <li><strong>Formspree</strong> and <strong>Web3Forms</strong> — form submission delivery, which forwards your enquiry to our business inbox and does not store it long-term;</li>
        <li><strong>Email providers</strong> — to receive and reply to your enquiry.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers process data on our instructions and are bound by their own privacy terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not use advertising or profiling cookies. Our host may set strictly necessary technical cookies, and privacy-friendly analytics may count visits without building a personal profile. If we add advertising or remarketing tags in future, this policy will be updated and a consent banner added first.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">6. Retention</h2>
      <p>Enquiries are kept for as long as needed to handle your request and maintain our commercial records — normally up to 3 years, or longer where export, tax or warranty rules require it.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may ask us to confirm what we hold about you, correct it, or delete it. Send the request to <a href="mailto:hntoys6@sinuotoys.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hntoys6@sinuotoys.com</a> and we will respond within 30 days. If you are in the EU/UK, you also have the right to object to processing and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">8. International Transfers</h2>
      <p>We are based in China, so an enquiry sent to us is transferred to and processed in China. We rely on your own request for a quotation as the basis for that transfer and limit use to the purposes above.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">9. Security</h2>
      <p>The site is served over HTTPS and access to enquiry inboxes is restricted to sales staff. No online transmission is completely secure, so please do not send sensitive documents through the contact forms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy mt-6">10. Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes materially, the updated date above will change. Continued use of the site after an update means you accept the revised policy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
